{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53862","headline":"阙题 · 李德裕","name":"阙题","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宛转双翘钗举，飘飘翠云轻楚楚。\n映烛看花未敢前，低鬟向人娇不语。\n（见《锦绣万花谷前集》卷十七《美人》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53862.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53862","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}